  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="64c675d1-969e-5369-b370-86aeca7261e0" activityNameId="680a3b14-ed0b-5766-b652-b417b2aa8b13" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Crude oil, production RAF, at long distance transport</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Crude oil, production RAF, at long distance transport
Transport of crude oil by pipeline to the Mediterranean Sea (e.g. Sirte or Algiers) followed by tanker transport to European sites at the Mediterranean Sea. The crude oil is then transported by pipeline to Switzerland.;
UUID: 78ebd806-53d3-35fe-98d6-bb979a4222e2
Transportation of crude oil from exploration site to refinery in Switzerland. Includes transport service requirements and emissions from oil handling and evaporation.
Location: Calculations based on assumptions for supply to Swiss refineries.
Technology: Operation of crude oil pipelines by electricity.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, statistics and own calculations. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_78ebd806-53d3-35fe-98d6-bb979a4222e2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
